{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-image-tiler#card-zh","repo":"meng-114/dsh-image-tiler","commit":"38f51cbfb859e46954f8c4b8787bdb81a5830848","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-tiler 是面向 DSH Web 的图像处理插件，将大图切成带行列与坐标标注的图块，并生成整体概览和清单。它注册 tile_image 与 read_tiles 工具：前者支持按尺寸或列行网格切片，后者可按区域、图块编号、工作台选择或图中目标返回需要查看的图块。Web 工作台提供网格调整、预览和勾选，拖入图片也可进入切片流程。适合需要让视觉模型检查高分辨率图片、局部细节或特定界面元素的场景；语义定位使用 DSH 当前路由的视觉模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:434-471","lib/index.js:625-645","lib/client.js:830-878","lib/tiler.js:283-375"]}
{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-image-tiler#card-en","repo":"meng-114/dsh-image-tiler","commit":"38f51cbfb859e46954f8c4b8787bdb81a5830848","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-image-tiler splits large images into labeled tiles with an overview. Its tools support size or grid layouts and selection by region, tile ID, workbench choice, or named target located by a vision model. The Web workbench previews and selects tiles, and image drops can start the workflow.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:434-471","lib/index.js:625-645","lib/client.js:830-878","lib/tiler.js:283-375"]}
