{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-image-tiler#feature-1","repo":"meng-114/dsh-image-tiler","commit":"38f51cbfb859e46954f8c4b8787bdb81a5830848","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-tiler 的功能「图像切片」：tile_image 将工作区图片按目标边长或指定列×行网格拆分，输出带坐标标注的图块、缩略概览和 manifest。可调整重叠、格式、标注及切片上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:470-505","lib/tiler.js:283-375"]}
{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-image-tiler#feature-2","repo":"meng-114/dsh-image-tiler","commit":"38f51cbfb859e46954f8c4b8787bdb81a5830848","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-tiler 的功能「按区域选择图块」：read_tiles 可按 center、left、right、top、bottom 或 full 区域选择与区域相交的图块，也可传入逗号分隔的图块编号，只返回选中图块路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:625-645","lib/index.js:731-735","lib/tiler.js:150-175"]}
{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-image-tiler#feature-3","repo":"meng-114/dsh-image-tiler","commit":"38f51cbfb859e46954f8c4b8787bdb81a5830848","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-tiler 的功能「按名称定位图块」：read_tiles 的 target 参数让视觉模型在概览图上定位自然语言描述的目标，再映射到原图并返回覆盖目标的图块；没有相交图块时选最近的一块。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:736-780","lib/vision.js:200-238","lib/tiler.js:193-234"]}
{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-image-tiler#feature-4","repo":"meng-114/dsh-image-tiler","commit":"38f51cbfb859e46954f8c4b8787bdb81a5830848","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-tiler 的功能「交互式切片工作台」：Web 工具卡片可调整网格、预览并勾选要查看的图块；确认后，无参数 read_tiles 会读取用户选择。拖入图片可触发工作区导入和工作台入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:363-395","lib/client.js:837-878","lib/index.js:717-730"]}
{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-image-tiler#caveat-vision-model","repo":"meng-114/dsh-image-tiler","commit":"38f51cbfb859e46954f8c4b8787bdb81a5830848","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-tiler 的 target 语义定位需要当前会话选择支持图像输入的视觉模型，或配置 visionProvider/visionModel；定位会将概览图交给 DSH attachments 服务并调用路由模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:749-768","lib/vision.js:200-225"]}
